OL,3,AShein aims for almost $27bn valuation
OL,4,Ain stock market debut
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe e-commerce giant is known for
OL,7,Fselling ultra-cheap clothes, backed by
OL,8,Fa vast network of factories in China
OL,9,Fthat are able to quickly manufacture
OL,10,Fnew products based on the latest
OL,11,Ftrends.
